  "body": "ASTERION REACH\nTHE STARS REMEMBER\n◈\n475+72\nCREDITS\n◇\n184+34\nMINERALS\n✧\n0+43\nSCIENCE\n⌘\n10 / 10\nORDERS\nРусский\nGalaxy\nResearch\nDiplomacy\nEmpire\nChronicle\nHome\n1\n2\n3\n⌂Solace\nCONCORD\n⌂Veyr Prime\nVEYR\n⌂Lumen\nCHOIR\nMeridian\nVOLCANIC\nHesper\nBARREN\nAurelia\nVOLCANIC\nCaldera\nGLACIAL\nEidolon\nOCEAN\nStillwater\nTERRAN\nOrison\nGLACIAL\nCinder\nOCEAN\nSundrift\nGLACIAL\nThalassa\nCHOIR\nOphion\nARID\nTethys\nKHAR\nHaven\nTERRAN\nAldebaran\nARID\nIona\nVOLCANIC\nHalcyon\nCONCORD\nAntares\nCONCORD\nSeraph\nBARREN\nPeregrine\nARID\nMorrow\nTERRAN\nZenith\nVOLCANIC\nEos\nVOLCANIC\nAsterion\nCONCORD\n△\n▴\n▴\nTHE ASTERION REACH\nTHE UNCHARTED EXPANSE\nCONCORD EXPLORATION AUTHORITY\nThe Asterion Reach\n\n35 charted systems · 33 surveyed · seed ASTERION\n\n+\n−\n⌖\nA CIVILIZATION TAKES SHAPE\n4 worlds share your future. Develop your economy, meet the frontier powers, and choose your path to victory.\nPER ASPERA, AD ASTRA\nCONCORD\nCHARTED\nUNKNOWN\n⌂ FOUNDING WORLD\nDORMANT LANE\nPathfinder 1 / Halcyon\n\nScout · 1 ship · 2 jumps · 18 / 18 hull · Select a star to plot a jump or a course.\n\nHold position\n⌁ 3\n⇥\n△\n▴\n▴\nPLANNED COURSE\nTethys · 3 jumps · 3 orders total\nContinue · up to 2 jumps\n⌖\nReplot\n×\n●\nHalcyon\n›\n1\nHaven\n›\n2\nZenith\n›\n3\nTethys\n\nUp to 2 orders now; stops for new contacts, discoveries or combat. Opposition unknown at 3 stops.\n\nStops before Tethys: Borders are closed. Replot or restore access before continuing.\n\nTHE CONCORD\nHalcyon\n\nGlacial world · Frontier system\n\nAncient ice hides a warm subsurface ocean.\n\n45%\nHABITABILITY\n2/6\nPOPULATION\n6\nPRODUCTION\nCOLONY PRODUCTION\n6 / CYCLE\n▥\nManufactory\n\n5 cycles to completion\n\n×\nINFRASTRUCTURE\n1 / 2 SLOTS\n◇ Orbital Extractor\n\n1 open slot. More population opens slots, up to five.\n\n⌂\nUnchartered\n\nGive this world a lasting specialty.\n\nDevelop →\n\n+7 credits · +10 minerals · +4 science\n\nEXPEDITION RECORD\n✦\nA Thousand Sleeping Voices\n\nBring them home · cycle 2\n\nRead expedition record →\nANCIENT STARLANES\n⌁ Iona ↗\n\nDormant · Not traversable\n\nRestore a permanent shortcut shared by all empires.\n\nReview restoration →\nIN ORBIT\n2 FLEETS\nPathfinder 1\nScout · 18 / 18 hull\nReady\n2 jumps\nLast Light of Haven\nFrigate · 34 / 34 hull\nHolding\n1 jump\nDEFENSIVE LEAD\n\nDefault formation order\n\nYour formations defend separately in the order listed above. A surviving attacker can still reach later defenders.\n\nSelect one of your military formations above to assign or clear its lead. Either change costs one order.\n\nORBITAL MAINTENANCE\n4 HULL / CYCLE\n\nAll your fleets here are fully repaired.\n\nShips at one colony share its repair capacity. Splitting or merging does not increase the total.\nCONNECTED SYSTEMS\nVelorum ↗\nSundrift ↗\nHaven ↗\nCycle 21\n2420 CE\nEND CYCLE →\nSPACE\n10 orders remaining · 4 colonies\nCycle 21: 1 dispatches available in your briefing.\nASTERION REACH / EARLY ACCESS 0.23.0\n● AUTOSAVED\nCampaign exported. Keep this file as your backup.\nRoute paused after 2 jumps. This fleet has used all its movement this turn.\nTurn 21: a new mandate begins.",
